無所怨咎程征北明之亦善不明之亦善諸君子自共為其心耳不在僕言也喜於是遂深文劾恕","source_position":{"source_layer":"pei_annotation","first_line":366,"last_line":373,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sgz016-duji-dushu/fixed-complete-unit.json"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:w0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"杜氏新書","kind":"work","person_id":null,"work_id":"w-dushi-xinshu-sgz016-reference","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"喜","kind":"person","person_id":"a42_j01_n4k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本章程申伯/程征北與青州田園讓事；已讀固定026田豫國讓及青州刺史程喜構陷之完整單元，確切共同事件而非同名猜。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"宋權","kind":"person","person_id":"br0_x62_x86","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"杜氏新書司馬宋權示恕，恕答權書同人；司馬為官非司馬姓，况示委曲未強認其字。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"br0_x62_x86","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"杜氏新書司馬宋權示恕，恕答權書同人；司馬為官非司馬姓，况示委曲未強認其字。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"况","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"况示委曲原字可能詞或書信稱用，不能僅以近宋權斷為其名/字。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038:m0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"僕","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳子恕嗣、務伯及幽州刺史，與034杜預父恕幽州刺史/幽死為具體父子官履橋。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit038